  id: 88
  missionName: KAGEHIRA'S TRUTH
  missionType: ENDURE
  briefing: Kagehira came back to his fortress alone but for his honour guard, and
    walked through the mutineers' lines without drawing. He is in the yard, and he
    wants to talk to the Kurogawa.
  debrief: He withdraws to raise his army. 'Open it, or I will burn my way to the
    summit and open it with your sister's hands.'
